      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Klient og endpoint</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">Intune, Autopilot, compliance og moderne enhetsforvaltning for trygg og effektiv arbeidsflate.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-lg">
      <div class="mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent transition-all duration-200 group-hover:w-16"></div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Sikkerhet og beskyttelse</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">Defender-plattformen, sikkerhetsforbedring, baseline-herding, overvåkning og beredskap.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-lg">
      <div class="mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent transition-all duration-200 group-hover:w-16"></div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Samarbeid og produktivitet</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">Microsoft 365, Teams, SharePoint og Exchange Online med fokus på styring, adopsjon og kontroll.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-lg">
      <div class="mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent transition-all duration-200 group-hover:w-16"></div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Virtuelle arbeidsflater</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">Azure Virtual Desktop og Windows 365 for fleksibel, sikker og skalerbar digital arbeidsplass.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand-accent hover:shadow-lg">
      <div class="mb-4 h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent transition-all duration-200 group-hover:w-16"></div>
